1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:06,150
On Slide 33, we inspect our Cryptographic Audit Trail.

2
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:16,260
In enterprise environments, "The AI did it, but we don't know why" is completely unacceptable. You need provable, tamper-evident accountability.

3
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:25,550
In Step 1, whenever the agent triggers an action, it records the exact timestamp, model version, and tool input.

4
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:37,770
In Step 2, each log entry is hashed using SHA-256, referencing the hash of the previous record. This creates an unbroken, tamper-proof blockchain-style ledger!

5
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:49,390
And in Step 3, the log is stored in an append-only Google Drive vault. If anyone tampers with a log entry, the hash chain breaks instantly.

6
00:00:50,090 --> 00:00:54,990
Total transparency and legal compliance built right into the architecture.

